2. Custom playlist module
Save these two files in the same folder.

playlist_utils.py
def get_total_duration(songs):
    total_seconds = sum(songs)
    return total_seconds / 60
main.py
from playlist_utils import get_total_duration

playlist = [210, 185, 242, 198]  # Song durations in seconds
total_minutes = get_total_duration(playlist)

print(f"Playlist duration: {total_minutes:.2f} minutes")
